         [1mDescription[0m
           In place of a name, a regular expression for the names of the metrics this entry is for, without their labels.  The entry is not a column on the line: it gives the metrics it matches its min, max, suffix, and divisor, and, if it is hidden, keeps them off the line.  A setting a matching entry with a name leaves out comes from the first matching pattern that has it.
